ia Loses at Utah Valley</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/19/wrestling-no-23-west-virginia-loses-at-utah-valley</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/19/wrestling-no-23-west-virginia-loses-at-utah-valley</guid><category>Wrestling</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Coliseum_PreDual" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2022/1/13/Coliseum_PreDual.png" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 23 West Virginia University wrestling team lost to Utah Valley, 20-14, at Lockhart Arena in Orem, Utah, on Thursday night.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2022/1/13/Coliseum_PreDual.png" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2022/1/13/Coliseum_PreDual.png"><media:title>Coliseum_PreDual</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2022/1/13/Coliseum_PreDual.png" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:09:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>18</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59732</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mimoso Sets Program Record to Highlight Third Day at OSU Invite</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/19/mens-swimming-diving-mimoso-sets-program-record-to-highlight-third-day-at-osu-invite</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/19/mens-swimming-diving-mimoso-sets-program-record-to-highlight-third-day-at-osu-invite</guid><category>Men's Swimming &amp; Diving, Women's Swimming &amp; Diving</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Rafael Mimoso swims breaststroke." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/19/ex1_31.jpg" /><br /><br />COLUMBUS, Ohio – Sophomore Rafael Mimoso set the program re