INION_NCAATOURNEY_1920x1080</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/19/WSOC_MATCHUP_VSOLDDOMINION_NCAATOURNEY_1920x1080.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>13</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59729</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Begin Sunflower State Swing with No. 16 Kansas on Friday Night</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/19/volleyball-mountaineers-begin-sunflower-state-swing-with-no-16-kansas-on-friday-night</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/19/volleyball-mountaineers-begin-sunflower-state-swing-with-no-16-kansas-on-friday-night</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU Volleyball team celebrates a service ace during the match against UCF" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/19/VB_WVUvsUCF_Nov15_2026_JC_252.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University volleyball team (13-11, 6-8 Big 12) travels to Lawrence, Kansas, on Friday, Nov. 20, for a matchup against No. 16 Kansas at Horejsi Family Volleyball Arena. First serve is set for 7:30 p.m. ET.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/19/VB_WVUvsUCF_Nov15_2026_JC_252.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/19/VB_WVUvsUCF_Nov15_2026_JC_252.jpg"><media:title>WVU Volleyball team celebrates a service ace during the match against UCF</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/19/VB_WVUvsUCF_Nov15_2026_JC_252.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:44